Package: graphMTP
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Graphical Multiple Testing Procedures
Version: 0.3.0
Config/graphMTP/Revision: graphMTP-final-20260910
Authors@R: c(
    person("Valerie", "Le", email = "hpl14@scarletmail.rutgers.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "Co-maintainer"),
    person("MengYang", "Yi", role = "aut", comment = "Co-maintainer"),
    person("Han", "Zhang", role = "aut"),
    person("Philip", "He", role = "aut"))
Description: A Shiny interface for specifying graphical multiple testing
    procedures and inspecting planned one-sided group-sequential analyses.
    Uses TrialSimulator for graphical updates, rpact for fixed-schedule
    sequential boundaries and gsDesign spending functions. Includes
    design validation, alpha recycling and JSON session
    persistence. Methods are described by Bretz et al. (2009)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.3495> and Maurer and Bretz (2013)
    <doi:10.1080/19466315.2013.807748>.
